  "html": "<!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n<noscript><iframe src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-N6XD44P\" height=\"0\" width=\"0\" style=\"display:none;visibility:hidden\"></iframe></noscript>\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hans-CN\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Ai-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:135px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/zh/wiki/File:Ai.png\" title=\"Ai.png (259 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:135px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/4/4d/Ai.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/135?cb=20251023162224&amp;path-prefix=zh\" title=\"Ai.png (259 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Ai.png\" data-image-key=\"Ai.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Ai.png (259 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Ai.png\" data-image-key=\"Ai.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/4/4d/Ai.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/135?cb=20251023162224&amp;path-prefix=zh\"></a></div></div></div></div><p>【角色名】A.I.\n</p><p>【初始区域】都市\n</p><p>【禁行区域】神社 医院 学校\n</p><p>【不安限度】 4\n</p><p>【属性】 造物\n</p><p>【特性】剧本制作时，该角色不能为“平民”。\n</p><p>判定该角色为当事人的事件是否发生时，该角色身上的所有指示物都视作不安指示物。\n</p><p>【友好能力】（友好3 1L1）选择公开信息表中记述的1个事件，处理该事件的效果。处理时，当事人默认为A.I.，且一切需要剧作家决定的内容由队长代为决定（所选事件本身不视作已发生）。\n</p><p>【感想】　柱子2号，主人公之友，天天开医院事故和谋杀的罪魁祸首\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260927032817\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1398/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_zhtragedyrooper:pcache:idhash:225-0!sseVary=RegularPage!userlang=zh-cn!zh-cn!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260927032817 and revision id 341. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
